<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Hinds County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 42% of normal in November to December and 62% in August to September. The 2026 numbers so far show 40% of normal in February to March and 157% in May to June on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
